# OS / editor. `.vscode/settings.json` was tracked from b3b3a4c9, where it
# arrived beside a component port rather than by decision. Its only content
# was a `files.exclude` map restating this file as an editor view
# preference, and the editor rewrites it, so it was churn nobody read.
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

